WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,970
Sister Rouer, why do you look so good today?

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:05,530
My mouth is also a little red. Was it bitten by someone last night?

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:07,530
Uh, maybe

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,680
Sure enough, I went out last night

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,820
It turns out it wasn’t just last night that I went out with

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,500
Already starting to bring things back

7
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,860
Sister Rouer, I have to see where you are next time.

8
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:30,793
an entrance

9
00:00:30,793 --> 00:00:39,060
Everything is food

10
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,540
This is the real camp

11
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,270
Move first and guard the entrance

12
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:44,430
Even if they walk nearby

13
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,270
I didn't know there was such a big place behind me.

14
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,020
Xu Rou'er, don't be lazy today

15
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:53,100
If you can’t pick coconuts, try to climb higher

16
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,180
Why don't you go yourself?

17
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,580
I am responsible for finding food, which is more important than your task

18
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:01,080
Sister Rouer, were you really just bitten yesterday?
